# eu-u9xj.6 (PP) — the `map` oracle for the fork half of the GC-safety gate
# (test_pp_gc_collects_during_par_map in harness_test.rs). Identical to
# pp_gc_fork_fixture.eu except that it uses `map` instead of `par-map`, so
# the parallel driver's answer is compared against ordinary evaluation rather
# than against another run of itself. Run without a heap limit and without GC
# stress, so it is fast and is not itself under test.

f(x): range(0, 100) map((_0 + x)) sum
xs: range(1, 60)
r: xs map(f)
n: r sum
